# kit

--- Attacher_gadget | gadget | TID_ATTACHER_GADGET_1_DESC
raw  Hide in a cardboard box becoming invisible for <VALUE1> seconds. Charges the Super <VALUE2> faster while stationary.
now  Hide in a cardboard box becoming invisible for <VALUE1> seconds. Charges the Super <VALUE2> faster while stationary.
  VALUE1  -  -> 3
  VALUE2  -  -> 100

--- Attacher_gadget_1 | gadget | TID_ATTACHER_GADGET_2_DESC
raw  Heals himself and the friendly Brawler he is attached to for <VALUE1>.
now  Heals himself and the friendly Brawler he is attached to for <VALUE1>.
  VALUE1  -  -> 30

--- Attacher_unique | star power | TID_ATTACHER_SP_1_DESC
raw  Kit gains <VALUE1>% power from each Power Cube.
now  Kit gains 1% power from each Power Cube.
  VALUE1  1  -> 150

--- Attacher_unique_2 | star power | TID_ATTACHER_SP_2_DESC
raw  Kit attaches to friendly Brawlers for <VALUE1> seconds longer.
now  Kit attaches to friendly Brawlers for 100 seconds longer.
  VALUE1  100  -> 5
